WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.160
Two medium Americanos.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.200
Coming right up. How's it going brother?

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.080
Did you read it yet?

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.589
What? Dude, how are you so fast?

00:00:15.589 --> 00:00:17.800
Aw, did you guys have your first kiss yet?

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.360
No, I'm waiting.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.578
Take her out of here.

00:00:20.578 --> 00:00:21.170
Kevin, you're a good man.

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:34.700
This neighborhood is concerned 
about the killing of a 17 year old.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.880
Do they have any idea who did it?

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.440
Whatever gang he's in and then they'll just hide him.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.200
Why is everyone saying it's a gang thing?

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:48.280
Police are still looking for leads in the case of slain Kennedy High School student, Kevin Broadus.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.840
Our emotions are raw.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:00.710
Everybody in this room is hurting.

00:01:01.769 --> 00:01:03.372
Kevin Broadus was not in the gang.

00:01:03.372 --> 00:01:04.522
We appreciate your time.

00:01:04.522 --> 00:01:06.438
Will you please send the next person in?

00:01:09.119 --> 00:01:10.593
My friend just got killed.

00:01:10.593 --> 00:01:14.449
You can't expect me just to sit
around and not do anything about it.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.600
The police have already made up their minds.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:20.160
They're gonna write this whole
thing off as a gang killing.

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:23.220
Someone needs to do something.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.420
Why are you so interested?

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:29.460
It just doesn't really make any
sense why anyone will kill Kevin?

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:33.599
I don't know why, but maybe we're just
gonna have to learn to live with that.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:37.764
You stop this nonsense.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.467
This is a murder investigation.

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:41.279
You don't know what could happen.

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:45.146
Addison, he's mixed up with some heavy people.

00:01:45.146 --> 00:01:45.869
They're dangerous.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:49.320
You said you got something for me.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.250
Do you see where we are right now?

00:01:57.689 --> 00:02:00.923
My wife had to find this. Are you a dealer?

00:02:00.923 --> 00:02:01.423
No!

00:02:01.423 --> 00:02:03.029
Were you supplying my son?

00:02:03.029 --> 00:02:05.029
No! Absolutely not!

00:02:05.719 --> 00:02:06.709
I'm worried about you.

00:02:06.709 --> 00:02:10.128
If you came here trying to talk me out 
of doing anything crazy, don't bother.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:12.890
I can't be a part of this anymore.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.900
Now I got nothing to lose.

00:02:15.959 --> 00:02:17.959
Addison, don't be stupid. Do not go there!

